            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Solid and Vacuum Mounted",
            "text": "<p>The MoonSurface is held up by two incredibly strong 4.5-inch round MoonMounts that easily hold 100lbs and give you the flexibility to mount your surface whenever and wherever you want. Yes, we tested it with 190 lbs—but don’t try this at home. For safe everyday use, keep loads well below this weight.</p>",
