    "collapsible_content_8zMDW8": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_ekND4t": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How is Moon Surface different from traditional camp tables? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>How is Moon Surface different from traditional camp tables? Fold-leg tables eat ground space, fight you on uneven terrain, and still wobble (and take up far too much space when you store them). Moon Surface mounts straight to your rig with vacuum anchors—no legs, no wobble, no hassle. Then it folds down to 2” wide for easy storage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_R7ePma": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will Moon Surface fit my vehicle?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes—if you’ve got at least 36 inches of smooth, non-porous panel space. Vans, SUVs, trucks, trailers, and RVs all work.<br/>How much weight can it hold?<br/><br/> We’ve tested it with up to 100 lbs. Stability depends on clean panels, snug straps, and firm bumper contact.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_R4tEna": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it scratch my paint?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No. Adjustable rubber bumpers spread the load and protect your finish. Just mount on clean panels so dirt doesn’t get trapped.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_k6jN3t": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s the grid pattern on the back for? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>That’s a MOLLE panel. It lets you clip or strap utensils, tools, or camp gear so your essentials are always right where you want them.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Pb8FKC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How big is it?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Open: 36 inches wide by 20 inches deep.<br/>Closed: 36 by 20 by just 2 inches flat. Big enough to prep a full meal, small enough to tuck away.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_K4iPMy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does it mount?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Moon Surface attaches with MoonMount vacuum anchors, the same system we use for MoonShade. Stick them to any clean, smooth surface, hook the table, tighten the straps, and twist the bumpers into place.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_W7kKVQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I move it around?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Pop the anchors off and stick them somewhere else on your rig if you want shade, more space, or a new view.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jnJfRq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it made in the USA?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yep, made in Indiana with US partners.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_KarhjE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When will I get mine?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We’ll share a full production and shipping timeline on Kickstarter. Backers will get updates every step of the way.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
